{"ID":"20240206091952-26js3rm","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206091952-26js3rm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091952-26js3rm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092003-gotlpn7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091955-17ko106\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092003-gotlpn7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:135,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:135\u0026#125;","title":"山柰（沙姜、三柰、三奈）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902085506"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092003-gotlpn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092003-gotlpn7","updated":"20240206092007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产福建、两广、闽南地区。\n【性状】\t干燥根茎为圆形或近圆形的厚片，直径1.52cm，厚26mm。外皮红棕色，皱缩，有时可见根痕、鳞叶残痕及环纹。断面灰白色，富于粉质，光滑而细腻，略凸起，而外皮皱缩。质脆，易折断。气芳香，略同樟脑；味辛辣 (但与姜味不同) 。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t温中，消食，止痛。治心腹冷痛，停食不化，跌打损伤，牙痛。用于胸隔胀满，脘腹冷痛。饮食不消。\n【注解】\t“缩皮凸肉”：指山柰横切片，边缘外皮向中间紧缩，中央常略鼓凸的特点。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091955-17ko106","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091955-17ko106","updated":"20240206091955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091955-q0w0mwi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712141104-mgspe0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712141104-mgspe0p","updated":"20240712141104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰-20240712141104-4j7ym7x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712141331-tvjtmis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712141331-tvjtmis","updated":"20240712141331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 579px;","style":"width: 569px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰 1-20240712141331-lsvntol.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 569px;\" parent-style=\"width: 579px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712144558-nx94f5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712144558-nx94f5v","updated":"20240712145304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 363px;","style":"width: 353px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰 5-20240712145302-35ggpku.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 353px;\" parent-style=\"width: 363px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830165249-0zvwuf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165249-0zvwuf5","updated":"20240830165249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 656px;","style":"width: 646px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沙姜 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沙姜 5-20240712143758-iya634c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 646px;\" parent-style=\"width: 656px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712141202-ye2rui3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712141202-ye2rui3","updated":"20240712143812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沙姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沙姜-20240712143347-u0b2vkw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 717px;","style":"width: 707px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰-20240712141202-wzfg2x5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 707px;\" parent-style=\"width: 717px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712143853-im1h04v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712143853-im1h04v","updated":"20240712144014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 444px;","style":"width: 434px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沙姜 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沙姜 7-20240712144014-lfsdn4t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 434px;\" parent-style=\"width: 444px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 679px;","style":"width: 669px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沙姜 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沙姜 6-20240712143845-ad748lu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 669px;\" parent-style=\"width: 679px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712143436-louc7xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712143436-louc7xh","updated":"20240712144842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 328px;","style":"width: 318px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沙姜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沙姜 2-20240712143436-3fyo7wf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 318px;\" parent-style=\"width: 328px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 328px;","style":"width: 318px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沙姜 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沙姜 3-20240712143513-hkpd0hd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 318px;\" parent-style=\"width: 328px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰 2-20240712144842-umt6qpf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240712144649-zhzskk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712144649-zhzskk0","updated":"20240712145143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 441px;","style":"width: 431px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰 3-20240712145042-vsj3e1w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 431px;\" parent-style=\"width: 441px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 777px;","style":"width: 767px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山柰 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山柰 4-20240712145140-1vwtg1h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 767px;\" parent-style=\"width: 777px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902085448-fqjt4bs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085448-fqjt4bs","updated":"20240902085453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为沙姜；"}]},{"ID":"20240712145330-tuvauwc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240712145330-tuvauwc"}},{"ID":"20240830165316-6issagp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-6issagp","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：山柰"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-pj5lc4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-pj5lc4v","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山柰《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-42wz0ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-42wz0ug","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShānNài"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-raa28kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-raa28kc","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】三藾、沙姜、山辣"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-iiyk5yr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-iiyk5yr","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为姜科植物山柰KaempferiagalangaL.的干燥根茎。冬季采挖，洗净，除去须根，切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-j220oiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-j220oiy","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，根状茎块状，单生或丛生，淡绿色，芳香；根从根状茎上生出，粗壮，多数。叶通常2枚，相对而生，几乎无柄，平卧地上，水平开展，质薄，圆形或宽卵形。8～9月开花，穗状花从两叶间生出，有花4～12朵，白色，晨开午调，芳香，花管筒细长。果实为朔果。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-uyao624","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-uyao624","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品多为圆形或近圆形的横切片，直径1～2cm，厚0.3～0.5cm。外皮浅褐色或黄褐色，皱缩，有的有根痕或残存须根；切面类白色，粉性，常鼓凸。质脆，易折断。气香特异，味辛辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-bh76vtg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-bh76vtg","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-pxp4rw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-pxp4rw5","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末类黄白色。淀粉粒众多，主为单粒，圆形、椭圆形或类三角形，多数扁平，直径5～30μm，脐点、层纹均不明显。油细胞类圆形或椭圆形，直径40～130μm，壁较薄，胞腔内含浅黄绿色或浅紫红色油滴。螺纹导管直径18～37μｍ。色素块不规则形，黄色或黄棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-jfb06pt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-jfb06pt","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末0.25g,加甲醇5ml,超声处理10分钟，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取对甲氧基肉桂酸乙酯对照品，加甲醇制成每1ml含5mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各2μl，分别点于同一硅胶ＧＦ254薄层板上，以正己烷-醋酸乙酯（18:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，置紫外光灯（254nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-0whm3rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-0whm3rw","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【含量测定】照挥发油测定法（附录ⅩD乙法）测定。本品含挥发油不得少于4.5％（ml/g）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-0763nnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-0763nnr","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-tpxcd4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-tpxcd4c","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-i21wsqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-i21wsqz","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】行气温中，消食，止痛。用于胸隔胀满，脘腹冷痛，饮食不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-fymmv7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-fymmv7t","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】6～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-4blinmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-4blinmp","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-z7zmpqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-z7zmpqr","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-ry94222","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-ry94222","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山柰《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-7oacm02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-7oacm02","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-xlp57ef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-xlp57ef","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShānNài"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-qzo88i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-qzo88i8","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】三奈子（《海上方》），三赖（《品汇精要》），三柰、山辣（《纲目》），三藾（《南越笔记》），沙姜（《岭南采药录》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-obcncd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-obcncd9","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为姜科植物山柰的根茎。12月至次年3月间，地上茎枯萎时，挖取二年生的根茎，洗去泥土，横切成片。用硫黄烟熏1天后，铺在竹席上晒干。切忌火烘，否则变成黑色，缺乏香气。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-obk3874","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-obk3874","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生宿根草本。块状根茎，单生或数枚连接，淡绿色或绿白色，芳香；根粗壮。无地上茎。叶2枚，几无柄，平卧地面上；圆形或阔卵形，长8～15厘米，宽5～12厘米，先端急尖或近钝形.基部阔楔形或圆形，质薄，绿色，有时叶缘及尖端有紫色渲染；叶脉10～12条；叶柄下延成鞘，长1～5厘米。穗状花序自叶鞘中出生，具花4～12朵，芳香；苞片披针形，绿色，长约2.5厘米，花萼与苞片等长；花冠管细长，长2.5～3厘米；花冠裂片狭披针形，白色.长1.2～1.5厘米；唇瓣阔大，径约2.5厘米，中部深裂，2裂瓣顶端各微凹白色，喉部紫红色；侧生的退化雄蕊花瓣状，倒卵形，白色，长约1.2厘米；药隔宽，顶部与方形冠筒连生；子房下位，3室，花柱细长，基部具二细长棒状附属物，柱头盘状，具缘毛。果实为蒴果。花期8～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-x56prx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-x56prx2","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】栽培于台湾、广东、广西、云南等地。主产广西。云南、广东、台湾亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-gpvf7xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-gpvf7xd","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥根茎为圆形或近圆形的厚片，直径1.5～2厘米，厚2～6毫米。外皮红棕色，皱缩，有时可见根痕、鳞叶残痕及环纹.断面灰白色，富于粉质，光滑而细腻，略凸起，而外皮皱缩，习称\"缩皮凸肉\"。质脆，易折断。气芳香，略同樟脑；味辛辣（但与姜味不同）。以色白、粉性足、饱满、气浓厚而辣味强者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-i1nq6ax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-i1nq6ax","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，筛去灰屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-1jrjnqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-1jrjnqu","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-9xyyl3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-9xyyl3x","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温."}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-qpi7yuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-qpi7yuh","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"味辛，性温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-a1a4pd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-a1a4pd6","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"味辛甘，性温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-9rc6r6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-9rc6r6u","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-2rijr5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-2rijr5d","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-fv1og6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-fv1og6m","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草汇言》：\"入足阳明、大阴、厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-rkvjqm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-rkvjqm7","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入心、脾、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-jn5fdzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-jn5fdzs","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-zdjio0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-zdjio0m","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"温中，消食，止痛。治心腹冷痛，停食不化，跌打损伤，牙痛。用于胸隔胀满，脘腹冷痛。饮食不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-xshri5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-xshri5z","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"辟秽气；为末擦牙，祛风止痛及牙宣口臭。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-38f02yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-38f02yl","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"暖中，辟瘴疠恶气。治心腹冷气痛，寒湿霍乱，风虫牙痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-hbkhunj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-hbkhunj","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"治停食不化，一切寒中诸证。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-fcbvl42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-fcbvl42","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《岭南采药录》：\"治跌打伤，又能消肿。治骨哽，以之和赤芍、威灵仙等分，水煎服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-qdnmc7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-qdnmc7o","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～2钱；或入丸、散。外用：捣敷，研末调敷或吹鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-zk6rpge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-zk6rpge","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚血亏，胃有郁火者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-5ixg34i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-5ixg34i","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-musv98o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-musv98o","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-v6h4wum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-v6h4wum","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治心腹冷痛：山柰、丁香、当归、甘草等分。为末，醋糊丸，梧子大。每服三十丸，酒下。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-n6kyawz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-n6kyawz","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治一切牙痛：山柰子二钱（用面裹煨热），麝香半钱。为细末，每用三字，口噙温水，随牙痛处一边鼻内搐之，漱水吐去，便可。（《海上方》麝香一字散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-i80rea4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-i80rea4","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治风虫牙痛：肥皂一个，去穰，内入三赖、甘松各三分，花椒、盐不拘多少，以塞肥皂满为度，用面包，炼红，取研为末，每日擦牙。（《摄生众妙方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-abwd2pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-abwd2pv","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-zptpqde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-zptpqde","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山柰《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-mtbbuqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-mtbbuqr","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目》：山柰俗讹为三柰，又讹为三赖，皆土音也。或云本名三辣，南人舌音呼山为三，呼辣如赖，故致谬误，其说甚通。山柰生广中，人家栽之。根叶皆如生姜，作樟木香气。土人食其根，如食姜。切断暴干，则皮赤黄色，肉白色，古之所谓廉姜，恐其类也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-fnuu1ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-fnuu1ov","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShānNài"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-an39xxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-an39xxa","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】GalangaResurrectionlilyRhizome,RhizomeofGalangaResurrectionlily"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-l0ejvwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-l0ejvwd","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】三奈子、三赖、三柰、山辣、三藾、沙姜"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-dpmmwa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-dpmmwa0","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-87jaymp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-87jaymp","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为姜科植物山柰的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-qrju85b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-qrju85b","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：KaempferiagalangaL."}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-u2jazje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-u2jazje","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：山柰于12月至翌年3月收获，挖取二年生根茎，洗去泥沙，剪去须根，切成1cm厚的薄片，用硫黄熏1d后，铺在竹度上晒干。切忌火炕，否则易变成黑色，减弱香气。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-jbruyt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-jbruyt6","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】山柰，多年生宿根草本。块状根茎，单生或数枚连接，淡绿色或绿白色，芳香；根粗壮。无地上茎。叶2枚，几无柄，平卧地面上；圆形或阔卵形，长8-15cm，宽5-12cm，先端急尖或近钝形，基部阔楔形或圆形，质薄，绿色，有时叶缘及尖端有紫色渲染；叶脉10-12条；叶柄下延成鞘，长1-5cm。穗状花序自叶鞘中出生，具花4-12朵，芳香；苞片披针形，绿色，长约2.5cm，花萼与苞片等长；花冠管细长，长2.5-3cm；花冠裂片狭披针形，白色，长1.2-1.5cm；唇瓣阔大，径约2.5cm，中部深裂，2裂瓣顶端备微凹白色，喉部紫红色；侧生的退化雄蕊花瓣状，倒卵形，白色，长约1.2cm；药隔宽，顶部与方形冠筒连生；子房下位，3室，花柱细长，基部具二细长棒状附属物，柱头盘状，具绿毛。果实为蒴果。花期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-syjcvid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-syjcvid","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-y3682tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-y3682tr","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山坡、林下、草丛中现多为栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-hjaxi6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-hjaxi6a","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于福建、台湾、广东、海南、广西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-nf0ovdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-nf0ovdg","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-81k3iuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-81k3iuh","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性，喜高温湿润气候和阳光充足的环境，较耐旱，不耐寒，7、8朋气温在30-36℃时生长旺盛。对土壤要求不严，但以富含有机质疏松的砂质壤土栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-ctdgqeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-ctdgqeu","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术，用种子和根茎繁殖。种子繁殖：春季3月中下旬播种，条播或点播行距10-15cm，株距5-6cm,每1hm2用种量22.5-3.kg。根茎繁殖：在收获时先留皮色鲜艳光这个子饱满而分芽多的根茎，贮于沙中越冬，于3月下旬至4月上旬折取一年生的根芽，用草木灰涂好伤口，随折随种，按20cm×20cm的行株距开穴，每穴种3段根茎，每1hm2用种量900-1050kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-stzvkdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-stzvkdf","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理，幼苗期中耕宜浅，并结合培土，封行后每隔2个月中耕除草1次。追肥分别于5、7、8朋施堆肥或厩肥。遇雨季要及时排除积水。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-vqbmfhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-vqbmfhc","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-gsf731q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-gsf731q","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别，根茎横切片圆开或近圆形，直径1-2cm，厚2-5mm，有时2-3个相连。外皮皱缩，浅褐色或黄褐色，有的有根痕及残存须根；切面类白色，富粉性，常略凸起，习称“缩皮凸肉”。质坚脆，易折断，气芳香，味辛辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-z7wdmb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-z7wdmb5","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以色白、粉性足、气香浓、味辛辣者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-iityans","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-iityans","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，粉末特征：类白色。①淀粉粒单位类圆形、椭圆形或类三角形，直径5-30μm，脐点，层纹不明显，偶见复粒。②油细胞类圆形或椭圆形，直径40-130μm，含浅黄绿色或浅紫红色油滴。③螺纹导管直径20-30μm，偶见梯形导管。④色素块黄色或黄棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-weclcn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-weclcn7","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】根茎含挥发油，其主要成分是对-甲氧基桂皮酸乙酯(ethyl-p-methoxycinnamate)，顺式及反式桂皮酸乙酯(ethylcinnamate)，顺式及反式桂皮酸乙酯(ethylcinnamate)，龙脑(borneol)，樟烯(camphene)，3-蒈烯(Δ3-carene)，对-甲氧基苏合香烯(p-methoxystyrene)，还含α-侧柏烯(α-thujene)，α-及β-蒎烯(pinene)，苯甲醛(benzaldehyde)，香桧烯(sabinene)，α及β-水芹烯(phellandrene)，对-聚伞花素(ρ-cymene)，柠檬烯(limonene)，1，8-桉叶素(1,8-cineole),4-松油醇(terpin-4-ol)，α-松油醇(α-terpineol)，优葛缕酮(eucarvone)，茴香醛(anisaldehyde)，乙酸龙脑酯(bornylacetate)，百里香酚(thymol)，α-松油醇乙酸酯(α-terpinylacetate)，β-榄香烯(β-elemene)，δ-芹子烯(δ-selinene)，十五烷(pentadecane)，γ-荜茄烯(γ-cadinene)，十六烷(hexadecane)，十七烷(heptadecane)，3-(4-甲氧基苯基)-2-甲基-2-丙烯酸[3-(4-methyoxyphenyl)-2-methyl-2-acrylicacid]，5-苯基噻唑(5-phenylthiazole)，3-亚甲基-6-异丙基环忆烯[3-methylene-6-(1-methylethyl)-cyclohexene]，β-松油醇，异龙脑(isoborneol)，2，5，6-三甲癸烷(2,5,6-trimethyldecane)，2，4，6-三甲基辛烷(2,4,6-trimethyloctane)，1a，2，3，4，4a，5，6，7b-八氢化-1，1，4，7-本甲基-1H-环丙[e]奥[1a,2,3,4,4a,5,6,7b-octahydro-1,1,4,7-tetramethyl-1H-cycloprop[e]azulene]，9，12-十八碳二烯醛(9,12-octadecadienal)。又含黄酮类成分：山柰酚(kaempferol)，山柰素(kaempferide)。还含维生素P。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-o7rqn83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-o7rqn83","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-sbetvl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-sbetvl5","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抗癌作用1985年KosugeT，等报道以山柰根茎中分得的反式-对甲氧基桂皮酸酯是一种细胞毒素成分，对人宫颈癌传代细胞（Helacells）具有较强的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-y5ewvt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-y5ewvt1","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对肠道平滑肌的作用根茎煎剂0.25-0.75%浓度对豚鼠离体肠管呈兴奋作用。而浓度增至1-1.25%则出现抑制作用；其挥发油的饱和水溶液与煎剂的作用类似。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-li5tmkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-li5tmkt","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抑菌作用根煎剂在试管内对许蓝氏毛癣菌及其蒙古变种、共心性毛癣菌、堇色毛癣菌等10种常见致病真菌均有不同程度的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-uq9hu9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-uq9hu9j","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其它作用山柰酚对动物有消炎作用及维生素P活性。其效力与槲皮甙相似，而较山柰甙为差。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-co8fvzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-co8fvzq","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-7dsl7pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-7dsl7pd","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）取本品粉末2g，加乙醚10ml，浸泡30min，时时振摇，滤过。滤液挥去乙醚，残渣加5%香草醛硫酸溶液1-2滴，显紫红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-hhy1tgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-hhy1tgd","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末2g，加乙醇10ml，置水浴上加热回流10min，放冷，滤过。取滤液1ml，加3%碳酸钠溶液1ml，加热3min，放冷后，加重氮苯磺酸试液1-2滴，显红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-sbg51qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-sbg51qr","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）薄层色谱，取本品粉末0.25g，加甲醇5ml，超声提取10min，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取对甲氧基桂皮酸乙酯对照品，加甲醇制成每1ml含5mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。吸取上述两种溶液各2μl，分别点于同一硅胶GF254薄层板上，以正忆烷-醋酸乙酯（18：1）为展开剂，开展取出，晾干，置紫外光灯（254nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照品角谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-5p8lkr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-5p8lkr0","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志《中华人民共和国药曲》1995年版规定：本品挥发油不得少于4.5%（ml/g）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-9ano5en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-9ano5en","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，筛去灰屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-c21v45o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-c21v45o","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-678vucw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-678vucw","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】胃、脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-h87h2yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-h87h2yf","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】温中除湿；行气消食；止痛。主脘腹冷痛；寒湿吐泻；霍乱；胸腹胀满，饮食不消，牙痛；风湿痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-qqqhsbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-qqqhsbp","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，6-9；或入丸散。外用：适量，捣敷；研末调敷，或搐鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-lghojsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-lghojsj","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚血亏及胃有郁火者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-5dos8l4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-5dos8l4","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】1.《本草正义》：山柰，李氏《纲目》称其辛温，谓暖中，辟瘴疠恶气，治心腹冷气痛，寒湿霍乱，盖味辛温而气芳香，辟寒行气，因亦与砂仁、蔻仁诸物相近，故治疗亦约略似之。又谓治风虫牙痛，则亦专行阳明，可作引经药，用与甘松同，必非辛温之物，可以独治阳明风火。2.《品汇精要》：辟秽气；为末擦牙，祛风止痛及牙宣口臭。3.《纲目》：暖中，辟瘴疠恶气。治心腹冷气痛，寒湿霍乱，风虫牙痛。4.《本草汇言》：治停食不化，一切寒中诸证。5.《岭南采药录》：冶跌打伤，又能消肿。治骨哽，以之和赤芍、威灵仙等分，水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165316-y8avl93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165316-y8avl93","updated":"20240830165322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830165317-pzsgm6h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830165317-pzsgm6h","updated":"20240830165322"}},{"ID":"20240830165318-0215oc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165318-0215oc6","updated":"20240830165322"}}]}